6. Nutrition breakdown estimates with percentages of daily values

Your response MUST be valid JSON with this structure:
{
  "rating": number,
  "ratingExplanation": string,
  "ingredients": {
    "concerning": [
      {
        "name": string,
        "risk": "high" | "medium" | "low",
        "impact": string,
        "whyAvoid": string,
        "scientificEvidence": string
      }
